

This directory contains circuits for multiplying two polynomials
over GF2. The circuit for multiplication of n-term polynomials
(i.e. degree n-1) is in file s_n_...

These circuits are at
http://cs-www.cs.yale.edu/homes/peralta/CircuitStuff/CMT.html

or at

https://csrc.nist.gov/Projects/Circuit-Complexity/Circuit-Problems


